\item[S2] Shalom Eliahou, \emph{A 64-modular Hadamard matrix of order 668}, Australasian Journal of Combinatorics 93(2) (2025), 422--427, §1, p.422. \url{https://ajc.maths.uq.edu.au/pdf/93/ajc_v93_p422.pdf}.
